namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamBorder {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder
    src   "A border whose hierarchy is code, not an asset: a face, a padding, and a hole to put things in.\n\nUMG's Border is a single-child panel that draws a brush behind whatever it holds, and this library\nalready offers that SHAPE as a palette panel -- an overlay carrying an image visual. This is the\nCONTROL spelling, and the difference is the one that runs through this whole family: a panel's\nbrush, colour and padding are authored per instance, and a control's come from the project style\nsheet, so restyling a project's boxes is one edit rather than one per box.\n\nSEVERAL CHILDREN, deliberately, where UMG's border takes one. The face carries an overlay, so a\n`Native.Border { A B }` stacks A under B with both filling the padded area -- which is what an\noverlay means and what a reader of those two lines expects. UDreamScrollBox's content slot makes\nthe same call for the same reason; a hole that took exactly one child would send every second\nchild somewhere invisible.\n\nThe outline is part of the face rather than a second widget: UDreamRectBlock draws a border of its\nown, so BorderThickness and BorderColor are pushed into the rect and cost no node. Zero thickness\nis UMG's plain border, which is what the style ships."
    text  "层级由代码而非资产定义的边框：一个表面、一段内边距，以及一个用来放东西的洞。\n\nUMG的Border是只容纳单个子项的面板，会在其承载的内容之后绘制笔刷，而本库\n已经以调色板面板的形式提供了那种外形——一个承载图像视觉的叠加层。这里是\n控件的写法，其中的区别贯穿整个家族：面板的笔刷、颜色和内边距\n按实例逐个编写，控件的这些则来自项目样式表，\n因此重设项目中方框的样式只需改一处，而不必每个方框改一次。\n\n这里刻意支持多个子项，而UMG的border只接受一个。表面承载一个叠加层，因此\n`Native.Border { A B }`会把A叠放在B之下，两者都填满内边距区域——这既是\n叠加层的本意，也是读这两行代码的人的预期。UDreamScrollBox的内容槽\n出于同样的理由做了同样的取舍；一个只接受恰好一个子项的洞，会把每隔一个\n子项都送到看不见的地方。\n\n轮廓属于表面本身，而不是第二个控件：UDreamRectBlock会自己绘制边框，\n因此BorderThickness和BorderColor被推入rect中，不额外消耗节点。厚度为零时\n就是UMG的普通边框，样式默认提供的也正是这种。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:bConsumeMouseEvents {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:bConsumeMouseEvents
    src   "Whether a reported pointer event stops here -- this framework's spelling of UMG's Handled.\n\nTrue (the default, and the event trigger's own) is Handled: the click is this border's and\nnothing behind it hears about it. False is Unhandled: the border listens and lets the event\ncarry on, which is what a decorative frame over a clickable thing wants."
    text  "上报的指针事件是否在此停下——本框架对UMG中Handled的写法。\n\nTrue（默认值，也是事件触发器自身的取值）表示Handled：这次点击属于此边框，\n其后的任何对象都收不到。False表示Unhandled：边框只监听，让事件\n继续传递，这正是可点击对象之上的装饰性外框所需要的。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:bReportMouseEvents {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:bReportMouseEvents
    src   "Whether this border reports the pointer -- UMG's four mouse events, off by default.\n\nOff costs nothing: no component is made at all. It is off rather than on because a border that\nstarts listening is a border that starts CONSUMING (see bConsumeMouseEvents), and every border\nalready in a project would quietly stop letting clicks through to whatever is behind it.\n\nThe face is already a raycast target, so turning this on changes what LISTENS, not what is hit."
    text  "此边框是否上报指针——即UMG的四个鼠标事件，默认关闭。\n\n关闭不产生任何开销：根本不会创建组件。默认关闭而不是开启，是因为开始监听的边框\n也会开始消耗（见bConsumeMouseEvents），而项目中已有的每个边框\n都会悄无声息地不再让点击穿透到其后的对象。\n\n表面本身已经是射线检测目标，因此开启此项改变的是谁在监听，而不是谁被命中。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:BrushColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:BrushColor
    src   "A tint over the style's background colour -- UMG's BrushColor, which is a tint over SBorder's\nbrush for the same reason: the style says what a border looks like, and this says what is\nhappening to this one right now. White is no opinion."
    text  "对样式背景色的着色——即UMG的BrushColor，它同样是对SBorder笔刷的着色：\n样式决定边框长什么样，而它说明此刻这个边框正发生什么。\n白色表示不作任何表态。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:ContentColorAndOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:ContentColorAndOpacity
    src   "A tint over the CONTENT -- UMG's ContentColorAndOpacity, colour and alpha both, and never over\nthe border's own face.\n\nIt is the hole's content tint (UDreamWidget::SetContentTint): every visual below the hole is\nmultiplied by it, in linear space, on its way to the screen, as SCompoundWidget blends its\nColorAndOpacity into the style its children paint with. Nothing inside is written to -- what\nthe host authored there is left as authored, and a white tint changes nothing -- and the\ncontent's RenderOpacity is left free for whatever fades it."
    text  "对内容的着色——即UMG的ContentColorAndOpacity，颜色与Alpha同时生效，且绝不作用于\n边框自身的表面。\n\n它是控件上这个洞的内容着色（UDreamWidget::SetContentTint）：洞之下的每个可视元素在\n送往屏幕的途中都会在线性空间中乘以它，正如SCompoundWidget把它的ColorAndOpacity\n混合进子级绘制所用的样式。内部内容不会被写入——宿主在其中编写的内容保持原样，\n白色着色不改变任何东西——内容的RenderOpacity（不透明度）\n则留给任何使其淡出的逻辑自由使用。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:ContentNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:ContentNode
    src   "The hole. Whatever a host nests on this control ends up here."
    text  "洞。宿主嵌套到此控件上的任何内容最终都会落在这里。"
    state machine
}

