DreamBorder:GetPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:GetPadding
    src   "What holds the content off the edge, read from the style in EFFECT rather than from the field\nbeside it -- so a border driven by the project sheet answers the number it is actually drawn\nwith rather than the one this instance happens to be carrying."
    text  "把内容挡在边缘之外的值，从当前生效的样式中读取，而不是读取旁边的字段——\n因此由项目样式表驱动的边框给出的是它实际绘制所用的数值，\n而不是这个实例碰巧携带的数值。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:HorizontalAlignment {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:HorizontalAlignment
    src   "Where the content sits inside the padded area -- UMG's HorizontalAlignment / VerticalAlignment.\n\nOn the CONTROL rather than in the style, because it is layout rather than look: two borders in\none project sharing a sheet routinely hold different things, and where a thing sits is that\nthing's business. Fill is what this control has always arranged, so an existing border does not\nmove."
    text  "内容在有内边距的区域内的位置——即UMG的水平与垂直对齐（HorizontalAlignment / VerticalAlignment）。\n\n放在控件上而不是样式中，因为这是布局而非外观：同一项目中共享样式表的两个边框\n常常容纳不同的内容，而内容摆在哪里是该内容自己的事。\nFill是这个控件一贯采用的排列方式，因此已有的边框\n不会移位。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:OnMouseButtonDownEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:OnMouseButtonDownEvent
    src   "The four moments UMG's border speaks, re-broadcast from the pointer system.\n\nSilent unless bReportMouseEvents is on -- binding alone does not wake them, because a control\ncannot tell when a Blueprint binds and guessing wrong would mean creating the component (and\nconsuming clicks) for every border in every project."
    text  "UMG边框会发出的四个时刻，由指针系统重新广播。\n\n除非开启bReportMouseEvents，否则保持静默——仅靠绑定不会唤醒它们，因为控件\n无法得知蓝图何时绑定，而猜错就意味着要为每个项目中的每个边框都创建该组件（并\n吞掉点击）。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:OnMouseDoubleClickEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:OnMouseDoubleClickEvent
    src   "The second press of a double click, and the fourth, and the sixth -- said at that PRESS, and in\nplace of OnMouseButtonDownEvent for it, which is how UBorder reports one: Slate routes the second\npress to OnMouseButtonDoubleClick and never to OnMouseButtonDown, so a double click here is one\nbutton down, one double click and two button ups.\n\nThe event system decides what counts as a double (its DoubleClickTime, the same widget and button,\nand a second press within the pointer's drag threshold of the first); this re-broadcasts that\ndecision rather than making a second one that could disagree with it."
    text  "双击的第二次按下、第四次按下和第六次按下——在该次按下时发出，并\n代替该次的OnMouseButtonDownEvent，这正是UBorder报告双击的方式：Slate会把第二次\n按下路由到OnMouseButtonDoubleClick，而绝不会路由到OnMouseButtonDown，所以这里的双击是\n一次按下、一次双击和两次抬起。\n\n事件系统决定什么算作双击（它的DoubleClickTime、同一控件和同一按键，\n以及第二次按下落在指针拖拽阈值之内）；这里只是重新广播该决定，\n而不是另做一次可能与之相悖的判断。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:OnMouseMoveEvent {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:OnMouseMoveEvent
    src   "Pointer MOTION over the border, which this system reports as the drag it is part of."
    text  "指针在边框上移动，本系统将其作为所属拖动的一部分上报。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetBrushFromSprite {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetBrushFromSprite
    src   "The other thing a face brush takes: an atlas sprite. UMG has no call for it because Slate has\nno atlas; here it is the cheaper of the two, so leaving it unreachable would make the\nexpensive road the only one a caller could find."
    text  "表面笔刷可接受的另一种资源：图集精灵。UMG没有对应的调用，因为Slate\n没有图集；在这里它是两者中开销较小的一种，若让它无从触达，就会让\n开销较大的那条路成为调用方唯一能找到的路。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetBrushFromTexture {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetBrushFromTexture
    src   "The common case of the above, and the one UMG spells: put this texture on the face and leave\nevery other thing about the brush where it was."
    text  "上述情形的常见用法，也是UMG所提供的那一个：将此纹理放到表面，并让\n笔刷的其他一切保持原样。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetContentColorAndOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetContentColorAndOpacity
    src   "See the property: colour and alpha both tint everything inside, and nothing of the face."
    text  "参见该属性：颜色和Alpha都会为内部的一切着色，而完全不影响表面。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetPadding
    src   "Every appearance setter below edits THIS INSTANCE'S style and re-pushes, because the padding,\nthe brush and the rest are one quantity and the style is where it lives -- a second copy on the\ncontrol is how a control and its style learn to disagree.\n\nWhich means they show up when this instance's style is what is in effect: StyleSource Inline,\nor Override with that field ticked, or a project with no sheet at all. Under a sheet they are\nwrites to a value the sheet is overruling, and the getters above say so by answering the\nresolved number."
    text  "以下每个外观设置函数编辑的都是本实例的样式并重新推送，因为内边距、\n笔刷及其余内容是一个整体，而样式正是它所在之处——在控件上再存一份副本，\n正是控件与其样式产生分歧的由来。\n\n这意味着只有当生效的是本实例的样式时，它们才会显现：StyleSource为Inline，\n或为Override（重载）且勾选了该字段，或项目根本没有样式表。在样式表之下，它们\n写入的是被样式表覆盖的值，上面的获取函数也正是通过返回解析后的\n数值来说明这一点。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetReportMouseEvents {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetReportMouseEvents
    src   "Makes or unmakes the listener on the face. Off destroys it, so an off border costs nothing."
    text  "在表面上创建或移除监听器。关闭时会销毁它，因此关闭状态的边框没有任何开销。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:SetStyle
    src   "This instance's whole look, replaced and pushed. See UDreamButton::SetStyle for the caveat."
    text  "本实例的完整外观，整体替换并推送。注意事项参见 UDreamButton::SetStyle。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorder:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorder:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect."
    text  "本实例自身的外观。只要StyleSource如此指定且样式表\n确实存在，项目样式表就优先；项目中没有任何样式表时，这里就是实际生效的外观。"
    state machine
}

DreamBorderPointerEvent__DelegateSignature {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamBorder.h#DreamBorderPointerEvent__DelegateSignature
    src   "A pointer moment on a border, carrying the whole event -- which button, where, how many clicks.\n\nIts own type rather than UUIEventTrigger's: a consumer binds to the CONTROL, and a delegate named\nafter the component the control happens to use inside itself would leak that choice into every\nBlueprint that listens.\n\nUMG's four mouse events hand back an FEventReply, so a handler decides per call whether the event\ncarries on to whatever is behind. Nothing in this event system asks a handler that question: an\nelement says once, for all its events, whether they bubble (UUIEventTrigger::AllowEventBubbleUp).\nSo the reply becomes a property here -- bConsumeMouseEvents -- and the events are plain multicasts,\nwhich is also what lets several listeners share one border."
    text  "边框上的一次指针事件，携带完整的事件信息——哪个按键、在哪里、点击了几次。\n\n它使用自己的类型而非UUIEventTrigger的类型：使用者绑定的是控件本身，而一个以控件内部恰好使用的组件命名的委托，\n会把这一选择泄漏到每个\n监听的蓝图中。\n\nUMG的四个鼠标事件会返回FEventReply，因此处理函数每次调用都要决定事件\n是否继续传递给后面的对象。本事件系统不向处理函数提出这个问题：元素\n一次性为其所有事件声明是否冒泡（UUIEventTrigger::AllowEventBubbleUp）。\n因此回复在这里变成了一个属性——bConsumeMouseEvents——而事件则是普通的多播，\n也正是这样多个监听者可以共享同一个边框。"
    state machine
}

